  "known_upstream_contract_gaps": [
    "Component schemas do not declare required fields, nullability, or closed object shapes.",
    "Pagination prose permits null nextPagePath while the OpenAPI declares only string.",
    "Rate-limit headers and the documented maximum page size are absent from the OpenAPI schema.",
    "The account-summary prose describes totalValue as total account value while the bundled schema describes it as investments value; Phase 1 retains the field but excludes it from Trading 212 value reconciliation until Demo behavior is verified.",
    "The official order-detail template uses {id}; the frozen contract uses the equivalent local alias {order_id}."
